# SuperFind web app settings. Copy to .env.production.local for a local production build;
# on Vercel set the same name under Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
# Only VITE_ values are read, and they end up in the browser bundle: never put keys or secrets here.

# The API's public address (https, no trailing slash), e.g. the Render URL.
# Required for `npm run build`: the build stops if it is missing or not an http(s) address.
# Leave it unset for `npm run dev`: the dev server proxies /api to the local API on 127.0.0.1:8000.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api-name.onrender.com
